{
  "description": "The training harness's hinge union, reduced to a CadQuery-centred 4 x 4 x 1 box and a radius-one cylinder centred parallel to its side: the ruling x = 2, z = 0 ends on the box's edges at y = ±2 (ADR-0088)",
